{"id":"4f2d2355efa286b3","group":"20","path":"20/20-prop-disjoint-ce-join.md","title":"c.e. 不交分裂与 degree join","display":"prop-disjoint-ce-join — c.e. 不交分裂与 degree join","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join","aliases":["20-prop-disjoint-ce-join"],"display":"prop-disjoint-ce-join — c.e. 不交分裂与 degree join","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Proposition 7.5.2","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-disjoint-ce-join — c.e. 不交分裂与 degree join"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 7.5.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=A_0\\cup A_1\">\\(B=A_0\\cup A_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}ce\\text{-}join}\\vdash\nB\\equiv_TA_0\\oplus A_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}ce\\text{-}join}\\vdash\nB\\equiv_TA_0\\oplus A_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 join 显然能判定并集。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是否在并集，若在，则交错枚举两边直到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 出现在唯一一边；若不在，立即否定。没有不交假设时该论证不能识别两边各自成员。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 7.5.2；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955",